msgid_plural "Every %(num)s hours"
msgstr[0] "A cada hora"
msgstr[1] "A cada %(num)s horas"

#: tracker/web/templates/help_apify.html:58
msgid "Each collection reads every active ad of your competitors again, so the cost grows with how many ads they run and how often you collect. Settings shows what Apify charged for every collection."
